{"3733940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TwentyOne", "steam_appid": 3733940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TwentyOne</strong> is a psychological single-player card game set in a <strong>corrupted city</strong> where a criminal mastermind runs an illegal gambling competition for his own sick entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/2112f997b150ac9d36c4288c64e7863a.poster.avif?t=1783168836\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/2112f997b150ac9d36c4288c64e7863a.webm?t=1783168836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/2112f997b150ac9d36c4288c64e7863a.mp4?t=1783168836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Gambit</strong>, a young man <strong>desperately</strong> trying to save his collapsing family by joining this high-stakes rat race. Face off in blackjack against a series of unique opponents, each bringing their own <strong>twisted rules</strong> and dark energy to the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the stakes rise, Gambit’s grip on reality slips. Watch as he falls into madness, plagued by hallucinations and a <strong>deteriorating mental state</strong>. To Gambit, there is only one goal left: become the <strong>Family Savior</strong>, no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/aa19c697782758caebdeef4ef4fa7e26.poster.avif?t=1783168836\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/aa19c697782758caebdeef4ef4fa7e26.webm?t=1783168836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/aa19c697782758caebdeef4ef4fa7e26.mp4?t=1783168836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Blackjack:</strong> Every opponent introduces a fresh, rule-bending twist to the classic game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narratives:</strong> Every competitor has a personal backstory engage in dialogue to uncover their secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices and performance determine the ultimate fate of Gambit and his family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narrative Confrontation:</strong> Engage in unsettling dialogues that blur the line between the character and the player.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TwentyOne</strong> is a psychological single-player card game set in a <strong>corrupted city</strong> where a criminal mastermind runs an illegal gambling competition for his own sick entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/2112f997b150ac9d36c4288c64e7863a.poster.avif?t=1783168836\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/2112f997b150ac9d36c4288c64e7863a.webm?t=1783168836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/2112f997b150ac9d36c4288c64e7863a.mp4?t=1783168836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Gambit</strong>, a young man <strong>desperately</strong> trying to save his collapsing family by joining this high-stakes rat race. Face off in blackjack against a series of unique opponents, each bringing their own <strong>twisted rules</strong> and dark energy to the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the stakes rise, Gambit’s grip on reality slips. Watch as he falls into madness, plagued by hallucinations and a <strong>deteriorating mental state</strong>. To Gambit, there is only one goal left: become the <strong>Family Savior</strong>, no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/aa19c697782758caebdeef4ef4fa7e26.poster.avif?t=1783168836\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/aa19c697782758caebdeef4ef4fa7e26.webm?t=1783168836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/aa19c697782758caebdeef4ef4fa7e26.mp4?t=1783168836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Blackjack:</strong> Every opponent introduces a fresh, rule-bending twist to the classic game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narratives:</strong> Every competitor has a personal backstory engage in dialogue to uncover their secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices and performance determine the ultimate fate of Gambit and his family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narrative Confrontation:</strong> Engage in unsettling dialogues that blur the line between the character and the player.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "TwentyOne is a psychological single-player card game set in a corrupted city. Play as Gambit, a young man losing himself to save his collapsing family. Enter a high-stakes blackjack competition with twisted rules and illegal gambling. Play the game, or let the game play you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/8f82dc0f5f6d95d2606b1ba091cb93ef28d322e2/header.jpg?t=1783168836", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/a5193ced757751ee16c6cd5ffaaa70aad0aefc85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783168836", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/a5193ced757751ee16c6cd5ffaaa70aad0aefc85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783168836", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce RTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["StuckArcader"], "publishers": ["StuckArcader"], "demos": [{"appid": 3863470, "description": ""}], "price